&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9.5pt;"&gt;合弁会社FECT CO., LTD.の全株式を譲渡し合弁を解消。&lt;/p&gt;
